        <body>
            <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="loc_ew.00150.jpg" type="recto"/>
            
            <lg type="poem">
                
                <head rend="underline">"The <subst><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h03" seq="1">endless</del> <del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2">boundless</add></del> <add place="above" seq="4"><metamark function="question">?</metamark></add></subst> <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above">real earthly</add> catalogue divine," complete."</head>
            
                <note type="textual"><add place="below" hand="#h02"><metamark function="add" target="#a002">&#8248;</metamark></add><add rend="underline" place="above" xml:id="a002" hand="#h02">Sunday&#8212;&#8212;</add><add place="above">went</add> This <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02"><add place="above" hand="#h04">Sunday <add place="above" hand="#h04"><metamark function="question">?</metamark></add></add></del> forenoon <del rend="overstrike">(for a rarity)</del> <del rend="overstrike">went</del> to church.  A college professor, Rev: Dr:&#8212;&#8212;&#8212; gave us a fine sermon, <del rend="overstrike">on</del> <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a003">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above">during</add> which I caught <del rend="overstrike">to</del> the above <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a004">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike"><add place="above" xml:id="a004">head&#11840;line</add></del> words: but the minister in his "catalogue" <del rend="overstrike">entirely</del> included only the good <del rend="overstrike">and</del> things, and entirely ignored what I <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1"><gap reason="illegible" extent="two characters"/>ddle</del> <add place="above" seq="2">name</add></subst> in the following:</note>
                
            <l><del rend="ovestrike">Not moral and the good <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a005">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike"><add place="above" xml:id="a005">and sound&#8212;</add></del>&#8212;not</del></l>
            <l><del rend="overstrike">Not the light alone but the dark</del></l>
            <l><del rend="overstrike">Not you alone nor me alone, nor <unclear reason="illegible" cert="high" resp="#tb">ours,</unclear><lb/> 
                America's, nor north or south alone</del></l>
            <l><add>The immoral and the dark,</add></l>
                <l>The dying and <subst hand="#h04"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the sick</del> <add place="above" seq="2">diseased</add></subst> <add place="above">were not</add> enclosed in this<lb/> 
                <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a006">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a006">huge</add> catalogue, <add hand="#h03">the hordes in Africa, <add place="above">were not</add></add></l>
            <l>The countless, <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#007">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a007">(nineteen twentieths)</add> low and evil, savage and<lb/> 
                crude, <subst><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h04" seq="1">were not</del> <add place="above" hand="#h03" seq="2">or north or south,</add></subst></l>
            <l><subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">Gaunt,</del> <add place="above" seq="2">The</add></subst> crazed, prisoners in jails, the<lb/> 
                bad, the horrible,<add hand="#h03">&#8212;aye myriad else</add></l>
            <l>Venom and filth, serpents, <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">ravine,</del> <add place="above" seq="2">the ravenous sharks,</add></subst> <del rend="overstrike">the</del><lb/>
                <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">slime and crawl,</del> <add place="above" seq="2">the liars, thieves, the dissolute,</add></subst></l>
            <l>Newts, crawling things in slime and mud</l>
                <milestone unit="glued"/>
            <l>The barren soil, the slag and dross and hideous rot, <add place="below">and slime</add></l>
             <l><handShift new="#h04"/>[<subst hand="#h01"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">Inside the rest</del> <add place="above" seq="2">Then inside all,</add></subst> the slag, the husks</l>
            <l><add>(A fancy-seed from bardic thought&#8212;a faith cohering all)</add></l>
                <l>Buried and hid beneath the <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a011">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01"><add place="above" xml:id="a011">guarded</add></del> mountain<del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">'s</del> <del rend="overstrike"><add place="above">and</add></del> <add place="above" rend="marked">rocks and soil</add> <del rend="overstrike">del</del></l>
            <l>A lustrous <del rend="overstrike">vital</del> sapphire blue, eternal <unclear reason="illegible" cert="high" resp="#tb">vital</unclear><lb/>
                 slumbers ready</l> 
                <metamark function="emphasize"><add hand="#h01">&#9759;</add></metamark>
                <l><add hand="#h01" rend="marked">What is the part the<lb/>wicked and the <choice><orig>loathes<lb/>ome</orig><reg>loathesome<lb/></reg></choice> bear within the <choice><orig><unclear reason="illegible" cert="low" resp="#km">boun<lb/>ded</unclear></orig><reg><unclear reason="illegible" cert="low" resp="#km">bounded</unclear></reg></choice><lb/> scheme</add></l>
            <l><del rend="overstrike">Inside the rest the slog</del></l>
                <l><subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">The</del> <del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2">A</add></del> <add place="above" seq="4">The</add></subst> centre <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">of</del> <add place="above" seq="2">for them</add></subst> all&#8212;<del rend="overstrike">husks</del> (perhaps the latent<lb/>
                    Deity of all.)<add>]</add></l>
            <l><handShift new="#h01"/><add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a009">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a009">Unending time</add> Unfolding time, revealing time, <del rend="overstrike">unending time,</del></l>
                <l><handShift new="#h04"/>(A <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">seed of</del> fancy<add place="below" hand="#h01"><metamark function="add" target="#a010">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a010" hand="#h01">&#11840;seed</add> from <del rend="overstrike"><add place="above">out</add></del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">a</del> bardic thought)<lb/><handShift new="#h01"/>&#8212;<del rend="overstrike">an</del> a faith, cohering all)</l>
            <l>Time, time, <del rend="overstrike">evolution,</del> revealer.</l>
            </lg>
            
            <pb xml:id="leaf001v" facs="loc_ew.00151.jpg" type="verso"/>
        
